IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mvtpi-ctp`

-- Motor Vehicle (Third Party Insurance) Act 1943 (WA) and Motor Vehicle (Third Party Insurance) Regulations 2009 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad
-- gen_wa_motor-vehicle-third-party-insurance-act-1943_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenarios au/wa): Chloe and Liam license a used $28,000 car in June 2034 (c074);
-- Jake, 22, a delivery rider on an e-bike, has his wrist broken by an opening car door in April 2029 (k044). Whether the
-- opening of the door was "a consequence of the driving" (s 3(7)) is a court's judgment, asserted both ways. The damages
-- figures use the 1 July 2010 Amounts A-D tabled in the deposit's note 1; the average weekly earnings are illustrative.

§ `fixtures`

