#ASSERT `Must my vehicle be insured` `Chloe's used car on the road`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my vehicle be insured` `Chloe's used car in the garage`
#ASSERT NOT `Must my vehicle be insured` `a State police car on duty`

#ASSERT NOT `Does CTP cover injuries caused by my e-bike or eRideable` `Jake's e-bike, not required to be licensed` FALSE
#ASSERT `Does CTP cover injuries caused by my e-bike or eRideable` `an e-bike with a s 4(9) policy` FALSE

#ASSERT `Am I an owner under the Act` `I have it under a hire purchase agreement`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I an owner under the Act` `I let it out under a hire purchase agreement`

§ `s 4(8), (8A), ss 19-21 -- is a policy in force` -- c074 Chloe licenses the car

#ASSERT `Is my vehicle covered` `Chloe's licence, current` EQUALS `covered by the policy that came with the licence (s 4(8A))`
#ASSERT `Is my vehicle covered` `a licence renewed on the 15th day after expiry` EQUALS `covered: the policy is extended until the renewal (s 21(2))`
#ASSERT `Is my vehicle covered` `a licence 10 days expired, not yet renewed` EQUALS `covered only if the licence is renewed within 15 days after it expired (s 21(2))`
#ASSERT `Is my vehicle covered` `a licence renewed 20 days after expiry` EQUALS `not covered: an uninsured motor vehicle from the day after expiry until renewal (s 21(4))`

#ASSERT NOT `Can my vehicle licence be granted or renewed` FALSE

#ASSERT `Does the policy carry on for me when I buy the vehicle` 

#ASSERT NOT `May the Commission end my policy early` FALSE

