§ `ss 7, 8, 3(1), 3(3A) -- whom the injured person claims against` -- k044 Jake

#ASSERT `Whom do I claim against` `Jake doored by a licensed car, the door held part of the driving` EQUALS `the owner or driver, as an insured person; the Insurance Commission conducts and pays the claim (ss 7(1), 11)`
#ASSERT `Whom do I claim against` `Jake doored by a licensed car, the door held not part of the driving` EQUALS `no claim under this Act`
#ASSERT `Whom do I claim against` `a hit-and-run by a car never identified` EQUALS `the Insurance Commission directly, if I made due search and inquiry and gave notice (s 7(3))`
#ASSERT `Whom do I claim against` `hit by an uninsured car whose driver is found` EQUALS `the owner or driver; if the judgment is unpaid after one month, the Insurance Commission (s 8(1))`
#ASSERT `Whom do I claim against` `hit by a Commonwealth car` EQUALS `the owner or driver under the general law; this Act gives no claim on the Commission`
#ASSERT `Whom do I claim against` `hit by another rider's e-bike that need not be licensed` EQUALS `no claim under this Act`

